  "notes": [
    {
      "kind": "idiom",
      "subject": "לפי חרב",
      "rationale": "Kĩhibirania kĩugaga 'kanua gwa cegũ' — kĩgeranio gĩa kũhĩa kwa cegũ; gĩatũũrwo ta kĩmwe nĩgeetha kĩoneke."
    },
    {
      "kind": "crux",
      "subject": "עיר בית הבעל",
      "rationale": "'Gĩciaro kĩa nyũmba ya Baari' kana 'kĩhingo kĩa thutha kĩa nyũmba ya Baari' (BSB); עיר ti 'gĩciaro' wiki no kĩhingo kĩa tonyanĩrio."
    },
    {
      "kind": "addition",
      "subject": "⟨arĩa herĩ ndani⟩",
      "rationale": "Kĩhibirania gĩtirĩ kĩuga kĩndũ ũguo — Yehu ndaagĩrĩiruo atĩrĩ; ĩngeretwo nĩgeetha ũhoro oneke."
    },
    {
      "kind": "wordplay",
      "subject": "שלשים",
      "rationale": "Kiugo kĩonanagia 'arĩa maarĩ gĩkundi kĩa gatatũ' — athĩnjĩri a Yehu aria mĩena ĩtatũ; kiugo kĩa gĩthomo gĩaikenio."
    }
  ],
  "translation": "Rĩrĩa Yehu arĩkĩtie gwĩka igooti rĩa kũhiũha, akĩuga ũrĩa arĩ mahiũhagia na ũrĩa arĩ mathatũ-rĩa: İthĩrai mũcenje ⟨arĩa herĩ ndani⟩, mũndũ ndakearĩrĩra kũira; namũcenjirie na kanua gwa cegũ, arĩa mahiũhagia na arĩa mathatũ-rĩa namatũũrĩirie magĩthĩra gĩciaro-inĩ kĩa nyũmba ya Baari.",
